# Tests are local-only — not tracked in the remote repo.
tests/

# Regression-harness output. These are rewritten byte-for-byte every time
# the suite runs, so tracking them puts 100+ files of pure churn in front of
# any real change -- 21 paddle reports were dirty in the tree before anyone
# touched recognition. The harnesses regenerate all of it from the fixtures.
#
# Deliberately NARROW: the rest of scripts/eval_out/ is cited evidence, not
# churn -- font_matching.py points at font-match-baseline.json, tofu.py at
# tofu-calibration-baseline.json, and cross-layer-architecture.md at several
# more. Those stay tracked. Whether the remaining ~640 one-off eval artifacts
# belong in git at all is the open question in docs/static-release-readiness.md.
scripts/eval_out/*-regression.paddle.json
scripts/eval_out/_memeval_*
scripts/eval_out/verification-baseline/
scripts/eval_out/verification-regression/
scripts/eval_out/tofu_manifests/

# Server runtime data
server/uploads/
server/outputs/
server/tm_thumbs/
server/tofu.db
server/inpainting-providers.json
server/models/
